::scene postcredits

Captain Nguyen:
DIVORCE WINNER?!

Neil Mcmanistan:
Oh fuck off!

Captain Nguyen:
YOU CAN'T JUST CREDIT Captain Nguyen AS THE Captain Nguyen! I'M THE Captain Nguyen!

ACTION npc_nguyen flips to the next page of the flip chart.

Captain Nguyen:
Real mature, man. Real mature. Your buddy Nguyen couldn't captain a rowboat — whipping out his root on live television, what the fuck was that?! She was right to leave you, man.

Neil Mcmanistan:
... fair observation...

ACTION npc_neil_mcmanistan pensively lights a cigarette, furrows his brow, and stares into the middle distance.

Neil Mcmanistan:
Join us next week when we are joined by our special guest — my wife's personal trainer — where we will fight a grudge match to the death!


